    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "for instance, I want to write `sa\"` in normal mode (no motions) and have it assume `iw` (like `saiw\"`) or whatever I write in a config option for a default motion.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">for instance, I want to write <code class=\"notranslate\">sa\"</code> in normal mode (no motions) and have it assume <code class=\"notranslate\">iw</code> (like <code class=\"notranslate\">saiw\"</code>) or whatever I write in a config option for a default motion.</p>",
    "bodyText": "for instance, I want to write sa\" in normal mode (no motions) and have it assume iw (like saiw\") or whatever I write in a config option for a default motion.",
    "category": {
